  "name": "SiulSC Guns - Realism Compatibility Patch",
  "slug": "siulsc-guns-realism-compatibility-patch",
  "teaser": "This adds SPT Realism compatibility for the weapon mods by SiulSC.",
  "thumbnail": "",
  "downloads": 2186,
  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<p><strong>Contents</strong></p>\n<p>Compatibility patches for the weapon mods by <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/28953-siulsc/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SiulSC</a></strong>.</p>\n<p>If you experience any issues, feel free to open an issue. If fixing it yourself is more your thing, there’s a guide on how to contribute on the GitHub repository.</p>\n<p><strong>Dependencies</strong></p>\n<p>Obviously, you’ll need the <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1704-ar-54-7-62x54mmr-designated-marksman-rifle-dmr/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AR-54</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1699-dvl-50-50-cal-single-shot-bolt-action-sniper-rifle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DVL-50</a></strong>, and/or <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1696-mk-12-ar-10-shotgun/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MK-12</a></strong> and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/606-spt-realism-mod/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>SPT Realism</strong></a> for this to do anything.</p>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<p>1. Remove the Realism incompatibility line from the mods, “\\user\\mods\\&lt;mod_folder&gt;\\package.json”, then save:</p>\n<p>“incompatibilities”: [ “SPT-Realism” ], 2. Download the latest release.</p>\n<p>3. Drop the provided user folder into your SPT folder.</p>\n<p>If the changes don’t load, you may want to also clear cache / temp files.</p>\n<p>1. In \\user\\cache, delete:</p>\n<p>bundleHashCache.json, jsonCache.json, and modCache.json</p>\n<p>But do NOT delete the folder named bundles.</p>\n<p>2. In the SPT launcher, clear temp files:</p>\n<p>Open launcher &gt; Click settings &gt; Click clean temp files</p>\n",
